WEBVTT

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.010
I'm not getting excited at all.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.010
Cheer up, Tachibana.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.660
But you see,

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.920
apparently I leveled up but my stats remain the same.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.500
Look properly, Tachibana.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.450
(Strength: 1  Agility: 1  Intelligence: 30  Luck: 83)
Your luck increased by three.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.120
What in the luck...

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.510
This is no different from reality!

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:55.140
Can't I have my dreams fulfilled in the parallel world!?

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:58.050
Come on.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.250
Look up ahead, we can see it now.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.270
It's a town!

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.840
Why are you still dawdling?

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.250
Let's go, Jinguji!

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.010
His mood swings are really something.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.490
(Episode 4  An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated Into
A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Black Swordsman)

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:24.650
This kind of feels like a marketplace in the Middle East.

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.750
I like things like this.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.790
However...

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.850
Why must I...

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:34.210
enter the town like this?

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.130
It's to prevent a pandemic.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.000
Just bear with it.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.840
Why are you treating me like a zombie or virus?!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.890
And I really stand out...

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.190
I don't like this parallel world.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:46.850
Excuse me.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.650
Will you buy this off me?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.710
...I want to go back to the modern era.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.880
I want to eat ramen noodles.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:55.860
Here.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:57.320
Thanks.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.870
The guardian deity's hide was worth 10 silver coins.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.420
It doesn't sell well, huh.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.070
Apparently the price would've been doubled
if it wasn't for the hole in the chest.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.840
I've got to think about how best
to deal a killing blow next time.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.730
Thanks for the food!

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.040
Can you keep that on forever?

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.180
No way!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.120
Hey, Jinguji.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:18.950
What is it?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.760
Isn't this super cool?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.620
Let's buy it!

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.690
Who is going to use something like that?

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:26.650
Wait!

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:27.730
That's a weapon shop!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:28.630
Let's go!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:31.780
Don't we need blades to cut through this and that?

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.020
If you want a blade,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.990
I gave you one as your birthday present to encourage
you to start cooking for yourself

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:40.220
but it was lying unused at the back of the kitchen,

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.120
you have that Damascus knife!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.320
Crap... this topic is a landmine.

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.610
I'm sorry about that knife!

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:48.060
But that aside,

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:51.250
if we're talking about fantasy, it has got to be a sword!

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:53.830
You're so insistent.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:57.840
Well, I certainly need knives other than a kitchen knife.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.460
Yes!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.270
Whoa... amazing!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.080
It's all real blades...

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.780
Do you have a whetstone and knife?

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.600
What will you be using it for?

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:11.440
Isn't it unfair that you get to do all the shopping?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.740
You're right.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.890
If you have something you need, just let me know.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:16.910
This!

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.380
If you have something you need, just let me know.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.430
Huh? Is it a bug?

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:22.500
I was saying I want this.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.940
The knife is for hunting and I'd like to try
a lot of things on the whetstone.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.200
Jinguji.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.620
Buy this for me.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.920
Ow!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.150
What was that for?!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.760
It's your fault for getting carried away.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:41.460
What you just did was the very behavior that I hate the most.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.220
I'm sorry.

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:45.380
It's fine if you get it.

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:48.560
That was close...

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.320
I was about to buy it for him.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.060
(Peerless Beauty)
Peerless Beauty.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.500
His appearance is even affecting him on the inside.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.190
To ensure that Tachibana doesn't go down the wrong path

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.250
I'll have to restrain myself.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.870
Are you traveling incognito?

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:02.170
Incognito?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:04.540
You are obviously hiding her face.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.830
But that only make her stand out more, so I got curious.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.910
You think so too?

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.560
Well, I have just the perfect item.

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:13.360
So I wondered...

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.920
This is a hair ornament that was enchanted
to ward off attention.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:18.750
I see.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.090
I can sell this to you at a discount.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.160
And your price?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.160
300 gold coins.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.760
What do you think?

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.190
Thank you for the knife and whetstone.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.740
Wait!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.320
Spending almost all the money we've gotten
at the village on that is just...

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.880
Hey, I was just thinking.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.280
Isn't this the perfect time to use my face?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.750
To haggle down the price.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.950
Well, I guess you could but...

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:46.690
I think the shopkeeper's livelihood is going to get ruined...

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.870
Hey, mister! Mister!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:52.610
Can you make it just a tiny bit cheaper?

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.890
How about I give you the entire shop?

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.090
It worked too well.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.060
What did I tell you?

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.890
This is the title for the shop.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.090
No, I don't need it.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:02.100
Then, what else do you want?

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.680
Weapon? Or is it money?

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.240
What should I offer you so you'll marry me?

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.260
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:11.860
Shopkeeper, I'm sorry but we don't want to buy...

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:20.740
Shopkeeper.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.460
What in the world did I...

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.260
That hair ornament just now,

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.840
I'll buy it, after all.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:28.350
Thank you!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:31.180
Who was that beauty?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:33.320
It was like a dream.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:37.000
I'd gladly worship a goddess like that!

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.570
I bought it.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.230
In any case,

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.490
it'll be a problem if he can't go outside all the time.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.810
This might be simply grasping at straws but...

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.330
A suit?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.810
Hey, Jinguji.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.930
I just realized something.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.450
You can make this door appear
and disappear at will, right?

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.690
Hm? Yeah.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.720
If I stay inside

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.410
and you do the traveling,

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.800
doesn't that mean I don't need to walk?

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:15.590
...Tachibana.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:20.400
I know you aren't the type of person
who would make use of me.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.680
You've already realized this, haven't you?!

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:26.950
If one of us can have it easy, then there's no need
for the both of us to tire ourselves out!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:27.780
Hmph.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.840
Let's assume that I travel alone,

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.800
that means leaving you alone in the room
after making the door disappear.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:37.090
Y-Yeah.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.860
What will happen if I die while the door has disappeared?

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.980
Then, just leave the door out...

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.710
If someone happens to come inside,

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.590
can you deal with that all alone?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.390
I'll just lock the door...

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.190
This is a world with magic.

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:53.110
Do you think locking the door would be useful?

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.600
But...

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:59.120
If I'm outside, I'll only cause trouble for everyone.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.380
That's where this comes in.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.870
N-No one is looking at me.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.610
Cool!

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.990
Don't go attracting attention now.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.680
It only wards off attention.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:16.320
The effect might decrease if you make a scene.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.290
Thanks, Jinguji.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:22.490
Now I'm free from this paper bag!

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:34.250
But, this guy stands out in his own way too.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.900
He's good looking

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.280
and wears a suit too.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.130
Shouldn't he change into something else?

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:42.440
What now?

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.700
Are you laughing because of how popular you are?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.460
No. You might have noticed it too.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.010
This immense bloodlust.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.880
Looks like we're being followed.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:53.420
I didn't notice it at all!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:55.180
Why did you laugh?

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.300
That's kind of scary.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:59.180
They are very bad at hiding their presence.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:02.330
Huh? Can't you feel this bloodlust?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.040
A normal human can't feel something like that.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.160
What the hell are you?

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.030
Just what are you made of?

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.110
Hey!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.540
I know you're following us!

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:10.930
How about you come out?

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.450
You bastard.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:16.560
Look at you, flirting in broad daylight in the town.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:22.420
Do you know how hard we had it after that, huh?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:23.210
Who are they?

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.670
You know, those bandits from the village...

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:29.070
I knew you wouldn't remember us

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:33.510
but I thought we will meet again if we come
to the nearest town.

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:37.140
It was a good idea to set things on fire
to help my buddies get away.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:41.010
But the fire spread too fast, my friends went poof.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.610
And my hair went poof!

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.530
That's not a bad rhyming for a bandit.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.440
Let's do this, Brother!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.080
Yeah...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.130
You are as lovely as ever.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.700
I can feel myself falling for you.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:55.920
Brother,

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.860
those lines are only spoken by people
who have already fallen in love!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.710
Don't look at her face!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:01.860
Is this a skit?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.540
I guess they will be charmed if they become aware of you.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.610
Kill the four-eyes and sell the girl to the nobles!

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:10.080
Die for the sake of our fortune!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.710
- I love you. I love you.
- This development somehow feels like a deja vu.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.420
Hello, you there in the suit.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:27.720
Am I right in assuming that you're
another one of the heroes?

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:29.700
Heroes?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.350
If you know what a suit is

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:35.890
that means you must have come from our world.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.050
Perhaps.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.940
May I ask for your name?

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:44.420
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.960
I'm the man who will become the hero of this world.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.410
Sorry, I can't remember your name because it was too long.

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.920
Can you repeat that?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.190
(Life With An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout)

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:58.720
Huh?

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:09.470
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.490
I'm one of the heroes summoned to this world.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.860
Why did he take off his cloak again?

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:16.990
A Japanese?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:17.990
Yeah.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:20.280
So, what's your name back in Japan?

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:23.120
I've left that name behind in that world.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.620
Right now, I am

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.620
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.470
I'm one of the heroes summoned to this world.

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.190
Right, so we'll be on our way.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.380
Wait, wait, wait!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:40.340
I went through the trouble to make contact,

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:42.730
what's with this cold treatment?

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.540
What else do you want from us?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.290
We don't want anything to do with you.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.600
Ow...

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.630
Now, now, Jinguji.

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.450
Let's just listen to what he has to say.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.800
I feel sorry just looking at him.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.620
If you say so...

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.250
He's someone who uses an alias on the first meeting.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:05.780
We'd better hide as much information as we can as well.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.770
If that's too hard, just add some fake details once a while.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.680
Well, rather than saying that's an alias...

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:12.960
Oh, whatever.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.240
Schwartz von Liechtenstein Lohengramm-kun,

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.430
is that fine?

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:19.820
Yeah, just call me Schwartz.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.200
I'm surprised you managed to remember it.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.780
I'm Watanabe.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.440
She's Audrey.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:26.130
Nice to meet you.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.590
Are you someone from this world, Audrey-san?

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.440
No, I'm...

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.930
How should I put this?

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.080
I-I'm sorry for looking right at your face!

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:46.420
Wow, you managed to pull yourself out of that,

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:48.510
you're certainly someone formidable.

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.580
Is such an evaluation criteria even okay?

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:53.760
Um, may I ask something?

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.180
Are you two

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:58.950
d-dating?

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:04.820
What?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.840
Did I ask something strange?

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.700
Oh, I see...

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:11.020
No matter how you see it, the age gap is obvious.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.940
They look rather like a father and daughter than lovers.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:18.140
W-We are dating.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:20.140
Huh?

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.770
Yeah, that's right, yes?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:23.080
We're dating, right?

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.720
What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:25.510
No!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:27.630
I'm sure we've sworn our love on that night!

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:28.580
Have you forgotten it?

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.540
I don't recall it!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:30.790
Hey, don't deny it!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.550
Weren't you the one who told me to add in fake details?!

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:34.610
You idiot, who'd say that out loud?

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.950
No matter how you'd think about it,
isn't it more natural to pretend that we are?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:38.930
I don't want to!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.970
I don't want to be seen in
that kind of relationship with you!

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.220
Don't say you don't want to!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.370
You hurt my feelings!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:46.640
You feel hurt?

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:47.640
Why?

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.440
Huh? No...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.180
I didn't mean anything strange by it...

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.970
T-This is... no way...

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:00.590
The guy is taking care of her in place of her parents

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:04.400
but the daughter developed feelings for him, that pattern!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.120
I've read it in light novels.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:11.090
I'm sure these two must have overcome many obstacles.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:13.170
She lost her home and her parents died.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.390
After she was saved, her frozen heart
gradually began to thaw.

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:18.650
And then...

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.480
But if that's the case

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:25.300
I don't understand why Watanabe-san would
deny their relationship.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.080
Could it be that

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.980
you have a fiancee back in the original world?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.250
That's possible!

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.000
There's no way an accomplished office worker like him

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.860
has no girlfriend!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.670
I'm sure Watanabe-san

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:41.840
would leave without saying anything
after this journey is over.

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:43.980
And when she finds out about it...

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.860
It's Audrey-san who will be hurt!

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:54.010
Then there is only one thing I can do for her.

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:56.010
Father.

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.740
No, I'm not her father.

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.720
No, I understand everything.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.520
Let me call you that.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.270
(Father-in-law)
Father-in-law, that is.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.530
No, you really didn't understand anything at all.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.810
I believe that blood relation isn't necessary

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.810
in forming a relationship between a parent and child.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.000
I agree with you on that

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.840
but why are you bringing that up now?

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:21.570
Father-in-law, you must be thinking this way:

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:25.550
Can someone weaker than me protect my daughter?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.180
You got charmed, aren't you?

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:29.770
I've finally found

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.530
a worthy opponent to unsheathe this sword.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.830
Let's duel, Watanabe-san!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.870
I'll show you

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.490
that I can surpass you and get Audrey-san!

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:42.120
Who's Audrey?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.580
That's you.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:46.550
Howl! My holy sword, Gram!

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:49.520
Gram? The cursed sword from Norse mythology?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.590
I believe there was a legend about
the sword cursing its owners with death...

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.360
but he calls it a holy sword?

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:56.600
Just accept it as it is.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.300
That's the holy sword, Gram.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.540
If he says so, then that's what it is.

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:13.880
What's up with that sword?

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.360
That slice was too powerful!

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.020
Yeah, I got slightly taken aback.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:20.530
If we hadn't dodge it, our heads would've flown off!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.730
Looks like he's serious.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.650
So you dodged it...

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:28.310
As expected of you, Father-in-law.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.180
That's a load of bull from someone who wanted
to kill us with his first move!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.260
That was too close!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.370
It's the first time I use this but that slice

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.840
won't stop making me break out in cold sweat!

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.210
I almost cut Audrey-san with it!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.660
I didn't think it would be this terrifying.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.310
If this goes on, I might end up destroying the town.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.200
I need to avoid the fight somehow

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.890
and find a way to convince Father-in-law.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.450
I can't contain it...

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.710
The power of darkness is overflowing in response
to the excitement that I haven't felt in a long time!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.380
Perhaps it's time for me

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.380
to get serious.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.430
I'll just threaten them by making them think
that there's more to my power!

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:07.780
I don't have any other ideas!

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:09.380
Play along with me, please!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.520
Just play along!

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.080
Are you saying that you weren't being serious?

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:14.310
That's it!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.360
Thank you, Audrey-san! I love you!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.210
I wasn't being serious at all.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.530
It's fine.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.210
Come.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.150
Show me how serious you can get.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:25.840
I can't turn back now...

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.220
I've got no choice.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.100
Here I come!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.390
Please prepare yourself, Father-in-law!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.110
This is my serious attack!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.200
Brace yourself!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.370
No, don't go saying "brace yourself."

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.330
Alright, suspect arrested.

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:42.130
Arrest those two over there too.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:43.340
Huh? Who are you? What's going on?

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:44.340
What is this?

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:48.220
We're the Vigilante Corps of this town
under the territory of Mercus.

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:51.840
You're under arrest under the charge of property damage.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.040
He ran away.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.400
No!

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:05.280
This isn't the type of parallel world reincarnation
I had imagined!

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.960
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:09.410
No, I was only doing the right thing.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:12.850
Well then, we'll be on our way...

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:14.900
Yes?

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.660
You're both important eyewitnesses.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.880
May I ask that you come willingly

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:20.930
to the station with us?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.070
We'll come.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.760
Like I said!

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:29.140
I'm a hero summoned to this world in order to save it!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.100
Right, you.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.870
How old are you this year?

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.000
That aside, this is an alias, isn't it?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.570
It's not an alias...

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.870
It's my soul name.

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.650
That's what I'm talking about.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.260
Besides, aren't heroes just a mere rumor?

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:45.540
Rumor?

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:49.590
Yeah, they say the king of demons is going to be resurrected.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:54.360
The oracle said that the goddesses have called forth
heroes in order to defeat him.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.360
King of demons?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.480
Goddesses...

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.180
There are more of them?

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.830
But I'm the real deal!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.240
Please believe me!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.540
Then can you prove that you're a hero?

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:07.000
A proof?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.160
What about this?

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.550
What's that?

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:14.080
This is the symbol that the goddess has bestowed upon me!

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:15.720
Or something of the sort!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.860
It does indeed look like crest of the Goddess of Night.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.100
How's that?

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.370
This should prove that I'm a hero
summoned by the goddess!

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:30.500
In other words, this is...

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:31.970
a crime of perjury!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.480
How dumb are you to add on to your list of charges?

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.890
Putting a goddess's crest on your body
is prohibited by the treaty.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:42.290
But this is real!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:45.220
So there are things like a goddess's crest, huh?

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.380
Do I have one?

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.690
Not from where I can see.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:53.520
I didn't see anything like that during bath either.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:56.260
Then, maybe it's where I don't usually see...

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.650
Like on my back?

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:01.920
Can you see anything?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.560
Is it there? Or not?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:07.350
Then maybe the armpit? Or my butt?

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.920
I don't like that idea.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.430
What's wrong?

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:13.100
No, sorry.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.180
I felt a nosebleed coming and tried to suppress it,
then it came out of my mouth.

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:18.870
Is nosebleed something you can suppress?

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.280
- Tap, tap, tap.
- What must I do? What must I do so you'll believe me?

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.350
Stop pulling me!

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.680
It's so lively today.

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.160
My lord.

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:28.090
Lord?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.020
What are you doing here?

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.050
It's nothing.

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:35.330
I heard there was someone powerful enough
to cut buildings into two with one strike.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.910
Are you the person responsible?

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:42.070
You're handling him quite severely
given the extent of damage.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.070
Come on, Lucius.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.970
No one got injured anyway.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.320
No one got injured.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.530
I'm glad.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.150
Injuries aside,

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:53.190
he cannot defend himself about the crest.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.810
He impersonated as a priest,

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.250
in short, he has committed perjury.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.710
I see...

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.810
But what if the crest is real?

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.700
That means,

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.160
he just have to prove that he's a real hero.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:08.630
What should he do?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.470
Let's see...

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.750
A hero who will save the world is obviously strong.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.880
Why don't we have him show us

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.230
his capabilities as a hero?

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:19.050
I'll do it!

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.480
You responded too quickly.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.980
Even though I suggested this,

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.330
shouldn't you answer after you hear about it?

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:29.510
I didn't expect that the chance to show
my capabilities would come so quickly.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.790
So he's the type who doesn't listen to others.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:33.790
Jinguji, isn't this...

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:34.500
Yeah.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.940
That errand quest that you get in games.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.420
It exists.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.860
Yeah, it really does exist.

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.080
This territory of Mercus is a point of distribution.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.690
Therefore, a lot of goods are transported
through the territory.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:47.860
Because of that,

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:51.780
there were many robberies that happened
along the routes nearby.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:00.110
The subjugation of a living armor
that only collects magic items.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.110
That's your quest this time.

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:36.340
My name is

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:37.680
- What is that guy doing?
- Schwartz von

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.770
- Liechtenstein Lohengramm.
- He said he's practicing to introduce himself coolly.

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:42.980
- I... - I'm impressed with his attitude of
going all out on everything.

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:45.200
- Schwa-kun grinned just now.
- My name is

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:46.550
- Could he have heard us?
- Schwartz von

00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:48.420
- He totally heard us.
- Liechtenstein Lohengramm.

00:23:48.520 --> 00:23:49.700
(Episode 5  An Ordinary Guy Who Reincarnated
Into A Total Fantasy Knockout And The Moving Armor)
